""

msgid ""
"- r1: cos值 ，shape要求输入为4维，一般为 ``[1, 1, S, D]`` 或 ``[1, S, 1, D]`` 或 ``[S, 1, 1, D]`` 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- r1: cos value. The shape requires the input to be 4-dimensional, typically ``[1, 1, S, D]``, ``[1, S, 1, D]``, or ``[S, 1, 1, D]``.\n"
""

