"- r2: sin 值，shape要求输入为4维，一般为 ``[1, 1, S, D]`` 或 ``[1, S, 1, D]`` 或 ``[S, 1, 1, D]`` 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- r2: The sine value. The input shape must be 4-dimensional, which is generally ``[1, 1, S, D]``, ``[1, S, 1, D]``, or ``[S, 1, 1, D]``.\n"
